  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* ControlSocket: duplicate VirtIO socket connection's file descriptor by @edi-oai in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1333\r\n* VMConfig: Save JSON with sorted keys by @mrpippy in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1326\r\n* Wait for collector in OpenTelemetry integration test by @yzhuang-oai in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1335\r\n* Add an option to disable USB accessories by @yzhuang-oai in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1338\r\n* Fix export overwrite confirmation on EOF by @LittleYier in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1342\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @mrpippy made their first contribution in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1326\r\n* @LittleYier made their first contribution in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1342\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/openai/tart/compare/2.37.0...2.38.0",
